    "title": "MICROSERVICE-apiwizdoc-List Healthcare Appointments Reminders-v2-spec",
    "description": "This API enables users to access and retrieve reminders for upcoming healthcare appointments. Designed primarily for healthcare providers and their systems, it facilitates seamless patient management by ensuring that individuals are notified of their scheduled visits. Users can query the status and details of appointment reminders, making it easier to manage patient interactions and enhance adherence to treatment plans. Use cases include integrating with patient portals, mobile apps, and third-party health management systems.",
